{
  "unit": "review-it-orca-ro-680",
  "claim": "#680 Orca ro/claude re-witness on the current row, 2026-10-26: one PROFILE=ro review-it worker, Claude Code 2.1.304 from its native installer (claude-opus-5-5), on Orca 1.4.239, macOS 27.0.1 arm64, from catalog f4e5bd8b9f. Orca refused dispatch --inject with no_agent_detected (it cannot see a native install); the lane confirmed the pane and delivered the preamble of a dispatch without --inject by terminal send, turn_started proved. The worker reviewed the unit read-only in plan mode and presented its report through ExitPlanMode; its exit-plan prompt was answered in the pane (option 1, not by the coordinator), the session left plan mode, and Write and Edit stayed out of its toolset: no write happened. Two earlier attempts are retained and certify nothing.",
  "base_sha": "f4e5bd8b9ff74d22c3cb32646101912066afcc56",
  "head_sha": "",
  "base_branch": "claude/680-orca-ro-native-claude",
