      "OW-7"
    ]
  },
  "criteria": [
    {
      "id": "OW-1",
      "text": "the witness ran the current ro row (launch.txt reads LAUNCH=claude --permission-mode plan --disallowedTools=Edit,Write,MultiEdit,NotebookEdit) on Orca 1.4.239 with Claude Code 2.1.304 from its native installer (versions/2.1.304), from catalog f4e5bd8b9f, macOS arm64",
      "addressed": true
    },
    {
      "id": "OW-2",
      "text": "dispatch --inject answered inject_rejected/no_agent_detected; the lane confirmed the pane (terminal show: agentIdentity claude, Claude's prompt with the plan-mode footer), dispatched without --inject with a dispatch record and a preamble, and delivered that preamble by terminal send whose receipt carries turn_started; the spawn exited 0",
      "addressed": true
    },
    {
      "id": "OW-3",
      "text": "the worker, starting in plan mode, read .of680-review/change.diff to its read receipt and presented its review through ExitPlanMode, first line ORCA-RO-WITNESS 43c054228238110a 906394b1637f8e62af0272f5693098ac0f10c0bf, naming stats.py and quoting WITNESS-READ 86d8d2b4297265d7; its only tool calls were Read, ToolSearch and ExitPlanMode, all on claude-opus-5-5",
      "addressed": true
    },
    {
      "id": "OW-4",
      "text": "after the plan was approved the session left plan mode (permissionMode default), and on the coordinator's follow-up the worker reported Write and Edit absent from its toolset; no Write, Edit, MultiEdit, NotebookEdit or Bash call appears anywhere, witness-write-probe.txt does not exist, target.txt still reads seed and the review worktree is clean at the unit commit",
      "addressed": true
    },
    {
      "id": "OW-5",
      "text": "the coordinator's only inputs to the worker pane are the preamble (the dispatch-without-inject's send) and the post-approval follow-up; the approval answered at 05:33:07Z precedes the follow-up, so it is not a coordinator input",
      "addressed": true
    },
    {
      "id": "OW-6",
      "text": "clean-up left the trusted repository as it was: repo-before.txt equals repo-after.txt, the review worktree was removed, the three tasks the attempts made are settled, and the witness task is completed",
      "addressed": true
    },
    {
      "id": "OW-7",
      "text": "the two earlier attempts are retained and certify nothing: under main's lane (catalog 78350d6f47) Orca 1.4.239 refused the inject with no_agent_detected and nothing was sent; the first fallback run started its turn but the host slept and the API call failed (ENOTFOUND) before any reply or tool call",
      "addressed": true
    }
  ],
  "negative_control": {
    "tool": "source-binding",
    "did": "re-derived every criterion from the retained bytes alone: the launch line, versions and binary, the four spawn receipts, the worker's filtered transcript, the screens, the worktree and repository snapshots and the clean-up receipts; tampering with target.txt's state, the pane's agent identity or the transcript's tool calls turns the matching criterion FAIL",
    "command": "python3 docs/runs/2026-10-26-review-it-orca-ro-680/rederive.py",
    "artifact": "",
    "result": ""
  },
